      "message": "Hi Mikhail, thanks for your comments. \nThe patch you mentioned doesn\u0027t seem to solve my problem. \nWhat I want is to use direct output for those sample rates \u003e 192khz or channels \u003e 2, but the patch rejects them. \n\nLet me explain my use cases. \nSometimes I want to route the audio directly to the card without mixing in frameworks, this means if the audio file is 96khz or 192khz, I want the pcm device opened with 96khz or 192khz, not the primary port setting (usually 48khz). \nCurrently in AudioPolicyManager::openDirectOutput, it rejects those sample rates \u003c\u003d SAMPLE_RATE_HZ_MAX. So I need to change SAMPLE_RATE_HZ_MAX from 192000 to 48000 to allow 96khz/192khz files to pass through direct output.\nIs there any other way to achieve this?\nThank you very much.",
